# Yasharn, Implacable Earth: "Players can't pay life ... to cast spells or activate abilities" (CR 101.2, 118.3, 601.2h,
# 602.2b). Before Yasharn, Bot1 casts Gitaxian Probe paying its {U/P} with 2 life (the positive control: 20 to 18). With
# Yasharn on the battlefield, Bot1's second Probe can't be cast with no blue mana (the 2 life can't be paid), and its
# opponent Bot2 is bound too: its untapped Mana Confluence ("{T}, Pay 1 life", a mana ability) is not offered, nor is its
# own Probe. On turn 3 Bot1 casts the Probe with an Island's blue: a Phyrexian symbol still has its mana to pay it, so the
# spell is cast, and no life is paid.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gitaxian Probe
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Yasharn, Implacable Earth
Gitaxian Probe
Island x2
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mana Confluence
Gitaxian Probe
Island x5
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gitaxian Probe.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yasharn, Implacable Earth.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Search()
! Bot1.Hand.Gitaxian Probe.Cast(Bot2)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mana Confluence.Play
! Bot2.Battlefield.Mana Confluence.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Gitaxian Probe.Cast(Bot1)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gitaxian Probe.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Gitaxian Probe; Black Lotus; Gitaxian Probe
Bot2.Battlefield.Mana Confluence.Tapped = false
Bot2.Hand = Gitaxian Probe; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
